{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Saddle Up and Drive&quot; is a game set in the 1970s, where you play as the reckless nephew of an old car driver, now an alcoholic deeply in debt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/2303f4f91211f76168a2b7fda275005f.poster.avif?t=1771512086\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/2303f4f91211f76168a2b7fda275005f.webm?t=1771512086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/2303f4f91211f76168a2b7fda275005f.mp4?t=1771512086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a way to earn your daily wage: smuggle (but don't get caught!), make good deals, or help the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/62219aba656340ddd7c5023332f23444.poster.avif?t=1771512086\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/62219aba656340ddd7c5023332f23444.webm?t=1771512086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/62219aba656340ddd7c5023332f23444.mp4?t=1771512086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can participate in various challenges, winning a lot of cash if you're capable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/272f9fc95fec9a705381f01e5ceb329e.poster.avif?t=1771512086\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/272f9fc95fec9a705381f01e5ceb329e.webm?t=1771512086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/272f9fc95fec9a705381f01e5ceb329e.mp4?t=1771512086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multitude of different vehicles await you, each with its own peculiar characteristics. Choose the most suitable vehicle for the mission you intend to undertake!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/769cc205d3c95e86a6d243637bc2fdf7.poster.avif?t=1771512086\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/769cc205d3c95e86a6d243637bc2fdf7.webm?t=1771512086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/769cc205d3c95e86a6d243637bc2fdf7.mp4?t=1771512086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast open world, consisting of one large map of about 50 km\u00b2, plus a lot of extra levels! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/e3a8e298a67447f86b42a3331ecf3a6f.poster.avif?t=1771512086\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/e3a8e298a67447f86b42a3331ecf3a6f.webm?t=1771512086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/e3a8e298a67447f86b42a3331ecf3a6f.mp4?t=1771512086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember! This game is best played with a controller, but you can still use a mouse and keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saddle Up and Drive is constantly being developed. Stay updated! Click 'Follow' on this page!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/7681a7cd1375fffc9df5ac10b524082d.poster.avif?t=1771512086\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/7681a7cd1375fffc9df5ac10b524082d.webm?t=1771512086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/7681a7cd1375fffc9df5ac10b524082d.mp4?t=1771512086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING!</strong> This game works correctly only on screens with a 16:9 aspect ratio, such as Full HD, 2K, and 4K.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2451620?t=1771512086","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771512086","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/9597a1d1d78c470a5e1f5ab6f8ae15ec54ca3616/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771512086","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/9597a1d1d78c470a5e1f5ab6f8ae15ec54ca3616/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771512086","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"In this game, there are references to committing crimes (smuggling, illegal races), and vehicle collisions are shown. The death of people is never explicitly shown, but it can be implied as a result of vehicle collisions. There are references to alcohol consumption in the game. Explicit/vulgar language may appear in the dialogues within the game."},"demos":[{"appid":3102690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Saddle Up and Drive&quot; is a game set in the 1970s, where you play as the reckless nephew of an old car driver, now an alcoholic deeply in debt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/2303f4f91211f76168a2b7fda275005f.poster.avif?t=1771512086\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/2303f4f91211f76168a2b7fda275005f.webm?t=1771512086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/2303f4f91211f76168a2b7fda275005f.mp4?t=1771512086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a way to earn your daily wage: smuggle (but don't get caught!), make good deals, or help the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/62219aba656340ddd7c5023332f23444.poster.avif?t=1771512086\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451620/extras/62219aba656340ddd7c5023332f23444.webm?t=1771512086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src